sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Admin/Staff
    participant FE as Frontend Webapp
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DashSvc as Dashboard Service
    participant OrderSvc as Order Service
    participant ProductSvc as Product Service
    participant InventorySvc as Inventory Service
    participant UserSvc as User Service
    participant AuditSvc as Audit Log Service
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Admin,DB: 7. Luồng admin dashboard

    Admin->>FE: Mở admin dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /dashboard/revenue
    API->>DashSvc: @PreAuthorize DASHBOARD_READ
    DashSvc->>DB: Aggregate revenue
    DB-->>DashSvc: Revenue stats
    API-->>FE: ApiResponse(revenue)

    par Tổng quan đơn hàng
        FE->>API: GET /dashboard/orders/summary
        API->>OrderSvc: Aggregate order status/count
        OrderSvc->>DB: Query order summary
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(order summary)
    and Top sản phẩm
        FE->>API: GET /dashboard/top-products
        API->>ProductSvc: Aggregate top products
        ProductSvc->>DB: Query best sellers/rentals
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(top products)
    and Cảnh báo tồn kho thấp
        FE->>API: GET /dashboard/low-stock
        API->>InventorySvc: Lấy sản phẩm tồn kho thấp
        InventorySvc->>DB: Query low stock products
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(low stock)
    and Biểu đồ đơn hàng theo ngày
        FE->>API: GET /dashboard/orders/daily-chart
        API->>OrderSvc: Aggregate daily orders
        OrderSvc->>DB: Query daily order stats
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(chart data)
    and Thống kê người dùng
        FE->>API: GET /dashboard/users/summary
        API->>UserSvc: Aggregate users
        UserSvc->>DB: Query user stats
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(user stats)
    and Hoạt động gần đây/audit log
        FE->>API: GET /audit-logs
        API->>AuditSvc: @PreAuthorize USER_READ
        AuditSvc->>DB: Query recent audit logs
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(audit logs)
    end

    FE-->>Admin: Render revenue, orders, top products, low stock, charts, users, recent activities
